    "end": 1801
   },
   {
    "text": "releasing energy.",
    "start": 1801,
    "end": 1872
   },
   {
    "text": "That helps move heat",
    "start": 1898,
    "end": 1957
   },
   {
    "text": "around the planet,",
    "start": 1957,
    "end": 2018
   },
   {
    "text": "through chemical changes.",
    "start": 2024,
    "end": 2117
   },
   {
    "text": "Its whole year lasts",
